From: OpenHarmony PC Developer Community <dev@openharmony.org>
Date: 2026-03-27
Subject: [PATCH] multiprocessing.util: abstract socket support for HarmonyOS

Extend abstract socket detection to include HarmonyOS.

Applies to: CPython 3.9.0
---
--- a/Lib/multiprocessing/util.py	2020-10-05 23:07:58.000000000 +0800
+++ b/Lib/multiprocessing/util.py	2026-03-25 10:53:39.365045937 +0800
@@ -106,7 +106,7 @@
 # Abstract socket support
 
 def _platform_supports_abstract_sockets():
-    if sys.platform == "linux":
+    if sys.platform == "linux" or sys.platform.startswith(("ohos", "harmonyos")):
         return True
     if hasattr(sys, 'getandroidapilevel'):
         return True
